{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FiresOut! is a chaotic couch co-op firefighting game for up to four players where teamwork makes the dream work... or total disaster! You and your friends play as animal firefighter interns who definitely did <i>not</i> sign up to rescue the entire neighborhood (but the captain believes in &quot;hands-on learning&quot; so here you are.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.poster.avif?t=1774238983\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.webm?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.mp4?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>TEAMWORK MAKES THE FISH WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to aim Mr. Glug Glug -a goldfish living in a toilet who blasts water like a fire hose. Make sure to manage the recoils - hang on to your (toilet) seat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.poster.avif?t=1774238983\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.webm?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.mp4?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SQUEEZE THE DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight corridors, winding stairs, falling debris and the occasional meteor while hauling your tools across burning chaos. With spaces this cramped, you'll need teamwork, timing and maybe a little friendly shoving to squeeze through in one piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.poster.avif?t=1774238983\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.webm?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.mp4?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GRAB 'N' GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop up fire victims and haul them to safety. Just don't forget to douse them first! \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fires solo or up to 4 players as firefighting interns. Support both local couch or online chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet gold fish as your fire extinguisher (his name's Mr Glug Glug).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry victims or yeet them. They're covered by insurance, anyway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your fire truck between 5 wacky worlds with unique game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocking fireballs, time bomb fireballs. Wait... we shouldn't send interns for this.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3983200?t=1774238983","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/f0669bc1a1bc3da275a4498d8b5ae02b10c14c47/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1774238983","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/77ba1f7387724e826e9f39a9e30bea517619d72c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774238983","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/77ba1f7387724e826e9f39a9e30bea517619d72c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774238983","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Subtitle Options","id":65},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >FiresOut! is a chaotic couch co-op firefighting game for up to four players where teamwork makes the dream work... or total disaster! You and your friends play as animal firefighter interns who definitely did <i>not</i> sign up to rescue the entire neighborhood (but the captain believes in &quot;hands-on learning&quot; so here you are.)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.poster.avif?t=1774238983\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.webm?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/03df5ab32f1ea4885f922313c13ee3a5.mp4?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>TEAMWORK MAKES THE FISH WORK</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up to aim Mr. Glug Glug -a goldfish living in a toilet who blasts water like a fire hose. Make sure to manage the recoils - hang on to your (toilet) seat!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.poster.avif?t=1774238983\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.webm?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/8ebd5d813fe0d6e895212080ff56034e.mp4?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>SQUEEZE THE DAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate tight corridors, winding stairs, falling debris and the occasional meteor while hauling your tools across burning chaos. With spaces this cramped, you'll need teamwork, timing and maybe a little friendly shoving to squeeze through in one piece.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.poster.avif?t=1774238983\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.webm?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/extras/144846cb1d9dc2dcb952337e83b302d8.mp4?t=1774238983\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>GRAB 'N' GO</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoop up fire victims and haul them to safety. Just don't forget to douse them first! \u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight fires solo or up to 4 players as firefighting interns. Support both local couch or online chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toilet gold fish as your fire extinguisher (his name's Mr Glug Glug).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Carry victims or yeet them. They're covered by insurance, anyway.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drive your fire truck between 5 wacky worlds with unique game mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blocking fireballs, time bomb fireballs. Wait... we shouldn't send interns for this.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","developers":["Dreamonaut Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3983200/16bd0ad3f4259546001d726fd6325845cb322b09/header.jpg?t=1774238983","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3983200/6715742/a0317ad6873d587d0f3a508b9919f4d386c9fbb8/1766028015/dash_av1.mpd?t=1766049342","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3983200/6715742/a0317ad6873d587d0f3a508b9919f4d386c9fbb8/1766028015/dash_h264.mpd?t=1766049342","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3983200/6715742/a0317ad6873d587d0f3a508b9919f4d386c9fbb8/1766028015/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1766049342","id":257188898,"name":"FiresOut! Game Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257188898/79051b18d921c261158155799b1dfcef749ba48c/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1766049342"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3983200/2118013154/6